the editorial review of the catalogue.

235
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:49,912
The next stage starts with a pilot
with a few partner institutions,

236
00:19:49,952 --> 00:19:53,211
whose feedback will set the priorities.

237
00:19:53,671 --> 00:19:59,770
On the roadmap: the intelligent
educational assistant, parent accounts,

238
00:19:59,810 --> 00:20:07,344
